<title>UK: LME list Chinese aluminium alloy brand.</title>
<headline>LME list Chinese aluminium alloy brand.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The London Metal Exchange (LME) has listed the SIGMA aluminium alloy brand of Chinese producer Shanghai Sigma Metals, an exchange notice said.</p>
<p>The refinery in the Bao Shan district has an annual capacity of around 84,000 tonnes.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 71 510 8075</p>
</text>
